; Warning policy, declared once for the whole tree.
;
; dev     : all warnings visible, none fatal. An unused variable mid-edit must
;           not stop the build.
; release : the same warnings, fatal. CI and any tagged build reject them.
;
; Disabled throughout: 4 (fragile match), 9 (missing record fields in pattern),
; 40/41/42 (constructor and label disambiguation), 44/45 (shadowing by open),
; 70 (missing .mli). All are noise given how the spec types are written.

(env
 (dev
  (flags (:standard -w +a-4-9-40-41-42-44-45-70 -warn-error -a)))
 (release
  (flags (:standard -w +a-4-9-40-41-42-44-45-70 -warn-error +a))))
